{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pigeon: A Love Story</i> is a game where you soar across to-scale replicas of iconic cities in search of your pigeon-shaped soulmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/b1bb0b4e3f63dacbc1a8ec3893d68c2a.poster.avif?t=1764415930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/b1bb0b4e3f63dacbc1a8ec3893d68c2a.webm?t=1764415930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/b1bb0b4e3f63dacbc1a8ec3893d68c2a.mp4?t=1764415930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a slow game for fast times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE-SIZE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore full-scale maps of London, New York, Tokyo and other international pigeon hubs: every building, every street, and every pigeon (we did the math).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIGEON-SIM\u2122 TECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of thousands of autonomous pigeon NPCs flying and interacting in a real-time, city-wide simulation. One of them is waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &quot;COO&quot;-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to collaborate, compete, or try to find each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game play itself, screensaver style, if you just feel like birdwatching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock in and zen out to a  soundtrack composed specifically for the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876710?t=1764415930","backg