 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &quot;COO&quot;-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to collaborate, compete, or try to find each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game play itself, screensaver style, if you just feel like birdwatching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock in and zen out to a  soundtrack composed specifically for the game.</p>","developers":["Wristwork"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/cd1d51f4d3350babe1caba6cb975fa7d7169bd19/header.jpg?t=1764415930","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  OpenGL compatible with 128MB VRAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3876710/616370489/5d2d880f2cbfcaeee9c7c76dad97bf19c5cbe2d5/1758211383/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758212855","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3876710/616370489/5d2d880f2cbfcaeee9c7c76dad97bf19c5cbe2d5/1758211383/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758212855","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3876710/61